{"id":"8959cc2a17246321","group":"90","path":"90/90-prop-kolmogorov-non-computable.md","title":"Kolmogorov Complexity Not Computable","display":"prop-kolmogorov-non-computable — Kolmogorov Complexity Not Computable","type":"proposition","metadata":{"type":"proposition","book":"Diagonalization and Self-Reference","book_abbrev":"90","label":"90-prop-kolmogorov-non-computable","aliases":["90-prop-kolmogorov-non-computable"],"display":"prop-kolmogorov-non-computable — Kolmogorov Complexity Not Computable","depends_on":["[[90-df-kolmogorov-complexity]]","[[90-df-recursive-function-class]]","[[90-prop-kolmogorov-unbounded]]","[[90-df-effective-procedure]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"proposition"},{"key":"book","html":"Diagonalization and Self-Reference"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"90"},{"key":"label","html":"90-prop-kolmogorov-non-computable"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>90-prop-kolmogorov-non-computable</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"prop-kolmogorov-non-computable — Kolmogorov Complexity Not Computable"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"7d83e22f672cfb25\" href=\"?note=7d83e22f672cfb25\" title=\"90-df-kolmogorov-complexity\">90-df-kolmogorov-complexity</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"137d75d038de4a47\" href=\"?note=137d75d038de4a47\" title=\"90-df-recursive-function-class\">90-df-recursive-function-class</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"1f8fee89a8d4aa2f\" href=\"?note=1f8fee89a8d4aa2f\" title=\"90-prop-kolmogorov-unbounded\">90-prop-kolmogorov-unbounded</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"4de0ebda11529dc6\" href=\"?note=4de0ebda11529dc6\" title=\"90-df-effective-procedure\">90-df-effective-procedure</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{OptimalPrefix}(U)\">\\(\\mathrm{OptimalPrefix}(U)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K_U\">\\(K_U\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"7d83e22f672cfb25\" href=\"?note=7d83e22f672cfb25\" title=\"90-df-kolmogorov-complexity\">90-df-kolmogorov-complexity</a>；无界性见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"1f8fee89a8d4aa2f\" href=\"?note=1f8fee89a8d4aa2f\" title=\"90-prop-kolmogorov-unbounded\">90-prop-kolmogorov-unbounded</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d:\\mathbb N\\to\\{0,1\\}^*\">\\(d:\\mathbb N\\to\\{0,1\\}^*\\)</span> 为双射，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Effective}(d)\">\\(\\mathrm{Effective}(d)\\)</span> 相对于 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"4de0ebda11529dc6\" href=\"?note=4de0ebda11529dc6\" title=\"90-df-effective-procedure\">90-df-effective-procedure</a> 的自然数二进制表示和字串恒等表示；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\widehat K_U\">\\(\\widehat K_U\\)</span> 是下式定义的数值函数。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Rec}_1\">\\(\\mathrm{Rec}_1\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"137d75d038de4a47\" href=\"?note=137d75d038de4a47\" title=\"90-df-recursive-function-class\">90-df-recursive-function-class</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\widehat K_U\\coloneqq K_U\\circ d,\\qquad \\widehat K_U:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\widehat K_U\\coloneqq K_U\\circ d,\\qquad \\widehat K_U:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"[\\mathrm{OptimalPrefix}(U)\\land d:\\mathbb N\\xrightarrow{\\sim}\\{0,1\\}^*\n\\land\\mathrm{Effective}(d)]\\Longrightarrow\\widehat K_U\\notin\\mathrm{Rec}_1.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[[\\mathrm{OptimalPrefix}(U)\\land d:\\mathbb N\\xrightarrow{\\sim}\\{0,1\\}^*\n\\land\\mathrm{Effective}(d)]\\Longrightarrow\\widehat K_U\\notin\\mathrm{Rec}_1.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Proof\">[Proof]</h2>\n<p>反设 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\widehat K_U\">\\(\\widehat K_U\\)</span> 可计算。给定字串 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\">\\(s\\)</span>，依次求 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d(0),d(1),\\ldots\">\\(d(0),d(1),\\ldots\\)</span> 直至遇到 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\">\\(s\\)</span>，可计算 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d^{-1}(s)\">\\(d^{-1}(s)\\)</span>，于是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K_U(s)=\\widehat K_U(d^{-1}(s))\">\\(K_U(s)=\\widehat K_U(d^{-1}(s))\\)</span> 也可计算。按长度递增、同长度按 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0&lt;1\">\\(0&lt;1\\)</span> 的字典序枚举字串，取第一个满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K_U(s)&gt;m\">\\(K_U(s)&gt;m\\)</span> 的字串为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b(m)\">\\(b(m)\\)</span>；无界性保证该搜索终止。</p>\n<p>令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w(m)\">\\(w(m)\\)</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m+1\">\\(m+1\\)</span> 的无前导零二进制展开，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\ell_m=|w(m)|\">\\(\\ell_m=|w(m)|\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{bin}(m)=1^{\\ell_m}0w(m)\">\\(\\operatorname{bin}(m)=1^{\\ell_m}0w(m)\\)</span>。它的长度为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"2\\ell_m+1\">\\(2\\ell_m+1\\)</span>，合法码集可判定且前缀自由；先读连续的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1\">\\(1\\)</span> 再读分隔符 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\">\\(0\\)</span> 即可确定后续精确长度。定义前缀机器 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V\">\\(V\\)</span> 仅在这些码上有定义，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V(\\operatorname{bin}(m))=b(m)\">\\(V(\\operatorname{bin}(m))=b(m)\\)</span>。最优性给出固定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c\">\\(c\\)</span>，使</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"m&lt;K_U(b(m))\\le2\\ell_m+1+c.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[m&lt;K_U(b(m))\\le2\\ell_m+1+c.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>而 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\ell_m=\\lfloor\\log_2(m+1)\\rfloor+1\">\\(\\ell_m=\\lfloor\\log_2(m+1)\\rfloor+1\\)</span>，故对充分大的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m\">\\(m\\)</span>，右端小于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m\">\\(m\\)</span>，矛盾。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>保留任意固定可计算双射 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d\">\\(d\\)</span> 的接口；证明中搜索使用先长度后字典序，不能把非良序的通常字典序当作可逐项穷尽的次序。未以另一个 Berry 文件的不可计算结论为本命题的前提。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Proof","text":"[Proof]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"90-df-kolmogorov-complexity","status":"resolved","id":"7d83e22f672cfb25","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-kolmogorov-complexity]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-recursive-function-class","status":"resolved","id":"137d75d038de4a47","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-recursive-function-class]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-prop-kolmogorov-unbounded","status":"resolved","id":"1f8fee89a8d4aa2f","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-prop-kolmogorov-unbounded]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-effective-procedure","status":"resolved","id":"4de0ebda11529dc6","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-effective-procedure]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-kolmogorov-complexity","status":"resolved","id":"7d83e22f672cfb25","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{OptimalPrefix}(U)$、$K_U$ 见 [[90-df-kolmogorov-complex